; beta keeps its node (it nests gamma) and fixes b1 in UTM48N; alpha is a
; leaf whose fix names no system, written after beta.
*begin beta
*cs UTM48N
*fix b1 500000 3000000 100
b1 b2 10.0 0 0
b2 gamma.g1 5.0 0 0
*begin gamma
g1 g2 10.0 0 0
*end gamma
*end beta
*begin alpha
*fix a1 0 0 0
a1 a2 10.0 0 0
*end alpha
